# Project Overview

This is an Agentic Report Generation system for multimodal data analysis. The project uses CrewAI to generate detailed reports from various data sources including health and YouTube data.

## Main Components

- [main.py](mdc:main.py): Entry point of the application
- [src/report_generation/](mdc:src/report_generation/): Main package containing all report generation code
- [backend/api/](mdc:backend/api/): FastAPI backend for the chatbot interface
- [requirements.txt](mdc:requirements.txt): Project dependencies
